sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant User as Batch User
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as openshift-kueue-operator<br/>60000/TCP metrics
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Webhook as kueue-webhook-service<br/>443/TCP→9443 HTTPS TLS
    participant Controller as kueue-controller-manager<br/>8081/TCP health
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus

    Note over Admin,CertMgr: Flow 1: Operator Reconciliation

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create Kueue CR (name: "cluster")<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: Kueue CR created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Check cert-manager API availability<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: cert-manager.io/v1/Issuer found
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Issuer + Certificate CRs<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    CertMgr-->>Operator: Certificates issued
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply bindata assets<br/>(CRDs, RBAC, Deployment, Services,<br/>Webhooks, NetworkPolicies)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources created/updated
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Generate ConfigMap from CR spec<br/>(framework integrations, feature gates)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over User,Controller: Flow 2: Workload Admission

    User->>K8sAPI: Create Job in managed namespace<br/>(label: kueue.openshift.io/managed=true)<br/>Auth: User credentials
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission webhook call<br/>HTTPS/TLS (cert-manager cert)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate + Mutate<br/>(check enabled frameworks)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: Job created (or rejected)

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch for new Workloads<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Workload event
    Controller->>Controller: Queue admission logic<br/>(check ClusterQueue quotas,<br/>preemption, gang scheduling)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workload status<br/>(admitted/pending)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over Prometheus,Controller: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>mTLS (cert-manager)<br/>Auth: Bearer token + client cert
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
